# =============================================================================
# CREDENTIALS NEVER LEAVE THIS MACHINE.
#
# set-env.ps1 holds the SERVICE ROLE key, which bypasses every RLS policy in
# supabase_live_log.sql - anyone holding it can edit or delete the live log.
# The schema's own header promises the key is not in this repository, and these
# rules are what keep that true.
#
# Anything matching these names is ignored regardless of extension, so a
# set-env.sh or a local-env.cmd added later is covered without a further edit.
# =============================================================================
set-env.*
*-env.ps1
*-env.sh
*.local.*
secrets.*
